      "completedAt": "2026-09-13T22:28:23.206Z",
      "finalAnswer": "John Serra's CareerTalkLab project is a standalone hybrid Learning Management System (LMS) designed for global professionals learning English. It uses a \"Flipped Classroom\" model, combining web-based lessons with live speaking practice sessions. The platform is built with Next.js 16.1, Supabase, and features a JSON-native lesson engine, AI feedback using Anthropic Claude API, and a Python-based news ingestion pipeline for content generation. The curriculum follows a CEFR-Task Hybrid Model, including an A1 Foundation, an A2 Business English course, and a Skills Lab for higher-level professionals [CareerTalkLab](https://johnserra.com/projects/careertalklab).\n\nThis project aligns with John's professional experience as an Education Coordinator at Amerikan Kültür Dil Okulları from May 2017 to October 2022. In this role, he developed a student feedback system, led the transition to online education using an LMS, developed curriculum, and built and trained a team of English teachers [John Serra — Professional CV](https://johnserra.com/cv/john-serra.en.md). CareerTalkLab directly reflects and expands upon these experiences by creating a comprehensive digital learning solution.\n\nCareerTalkLab is listed as a work-in-progress project on John's CV, with a status of \"Work in progress\" and dates from March 2026 to present. It is described as evolving into a long-term personal effort to share knowledge and help others learn, with business English as one part and a planned data analytics curriculum [John Serra — Professional CV](https://johnserra.com/cv/john-serra.en.md). This indicates a continuation of his interest in education and curriculum development, now with a strong focus on software development and automation, which are also listed among his skills [John Serra — Professional CV](https://johnserra.com/cv/john-serra.en.md).",
